# Vendored Fab packs — re-downloadable from the launcher, and far too big to
# version. PWL_Light_Manager is 235 MB and ProceduralBuildingGenerator 681 MB;
# together they are the whole free Git LFS tier in one commit, and LFS storage
# is never reclaimed once spent. SETUP.md section 3a lists what to reinstall.
DirtbagUE/Content/PWL_Light_Manager/
DirtbagUE/Content/ProceduralBuildingGenerator/
